[{"title":"题亡室涧蘋遗稿 其二","author":"陈裔仲","text":"光阴顷刻指空弹，别易从知会愈难。\n纵有残脂和剩粉，可怜一见一心酸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20150,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题亡室涧蘋遗稿 其三","author":"陈裔仲","text":"遗稿长留手自删，玉容寂寞几时还。\n当年有约君须记，暂撇愁肠破笑颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20151,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泾皋馆中作","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"听得邻家笑语温，娇痴儿女话黄昏。\n何人踏月归来晚，剥啄街头尚扣门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20152,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酌胶山泉","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"今生若是论生前，不是茶神即酒仙。\n万事有缘君识否？\n此来为品第三泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20153,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贺严竹坪纳宠生子时正中秋佳节也二首 其一","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"嫦娥本是月中仙，修到灵根福寿全。\n桂子初从天上落，教君月饼佐汤筵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20154,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"贺严竹坪纳宠生子时正中秋佳节也二首 其二","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"小住琼楼不计年，霓裳舞罢大罗天。\n中秋为爱人间好，来向君家作谪仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20155,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟中望月","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"轻舟暂过蓼滩前，水气空濛夜色妍。\n银浦秋高山影瘦，碧天云净月轮圆。\n渔矶结草皆成屋，蟹簖横波不碍船。\n断续歌声听未已，半篷芦苇满溪烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20156,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自杨厍夜归华墅","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"西山日落已无痕，露湿罗衫渐减温。\n历碌驹轮走清夜，零星萤火照黄昏。\n月明松径僧归寺，云护溪林犬吠村。\n入室挑灯咸问讯，渔人空说武陵源。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20157,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有王姓女时占反目匿余家数日其夫来晓之以义而去","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"红颜翻作白头吟，累尔离居泪满襟。\n权做花铃护秋艳，欲捶羯鼓散春阴。\n岂因丽质垂青眼，忍听酸言冷素心。\n送子还家无别语，瑶琴休鼓不平音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20158,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中感怀 其一","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"课子无期志渐衰，频年浪枻有馀哀。\n客中归梦云无定，病里离愁雨送来。\n倦眼怕看灯檠火，名心冷拨药炉灰。\n何年竹屋茅亭建，门对芙蓉九朵开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20159,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病中感怀 其二","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"气血将衰事易忘，中年无志转荒唐。\n悔抛书卷求名懒，误逐风尘为口忙。\n抱子未知能式谷，娶妻差喜识糟糠。\n从头想到亲恩厚，未报涓埃暗自伤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20160,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜不成寐望月有感","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"蕉窗寂静已更深，银蜡烧残玉漏沉。\n万缕清愁传夜柝，半床幽梦碎秋砧。\n声闻寒鹤作长啸，目送飞鸿动远吟。\n睡起怀人清不寐，一帘明月照罗衾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20161,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋风","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"身如梁燕往来频，玉臂云鬟梦里亲。\n待折菊花开笑口，秋风恐瘦捲帘人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20162,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落叶","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"落叶萧萧百卉非，小园终日掩柴扉。\n梧阶露冷寒螀咽，豆圃烟荒瘦蝶飞。\n病里每嫌秋寂寂，愁中况值雨霏霏。\n夜深时觉眠难稳，恼听邻机织未稀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20163,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日病后作","author":"陆祖瀛","text":"惊起流莺绕树飞，乍开倦眼赏芳菲。\n恨随柳线论长短，人向梅花较瘦肥。\n药与病魔争岁月，花留娇鸟弄春晖。\n今番别有天然趣，一径苍苔独掩扉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20164,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨舟中 其一","author":"蒋葆元","text":"山容洗出净无瑕，石径荒凉起暮鸦。\n浩渺烟波秋色老，一篷凉雪压芦花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20165,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨舟中 其二","author":"蒋葆元","text":"水迢迢更路迢迢，放棹黄昏趁晚潮。\n细雨斜风云气湿，橹声摇梦过双桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20166,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其一","author":"蒋葆元","text":"玉宇澄秋色，微云淡碧空。\n香车初洗雨，仙佩不禁风。\n泪纵相思洒，情还历劫通。\n伤心怜月姊，深锁广寒宫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20167,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其二","author":"蒋葆元","text":"一岁一相见，长留终古盟。\n空嗟尘世梦，惯作别离情。\n纤月描眉影，香风隐佩声。\n年年当此夕，珍重夜三更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20168,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白秋海棠","author":"蒋葆元","text":"月华香艳露华凝，姑射仙人唤未应。\n剪取秋魂娇欲语，一枝清绝伴书灯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20169,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜怀友人","author":"蒋葆元","text":"不作远游客，那知离别情。\n怜君年最少，于我谊弥亲。\n凉意侵蟾影，秋怀起雁声。\n几时酬旧志，烟水订鸥盟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20170,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黑夜自郡城返大岸村","author":"蒋葆元","text":"冲破暮烟碧，帆飞积水吞。\n霜寒降酒力，月冷浸诗魂。\n老树森疑鬼，深篁静掩门。\n橹声惊犬吠，知是近前村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20171,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客中秋雨接家书寒衣二首 其一","author":"蒋葆元","text":"不尽缠绵意，寒衣远寄将。\n线同心事密，泪杂墨痕香。\n骨瘦秋先觉，愁多夜倍长。\n孤衾寒似铁，怎入黑甜乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20172,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客中秋雨接家书寒衣二首 其二","author":"蒋葆元","text":"珍重一函捧，未开心已愁。\n还将两行泪，并作十分秋。\n新恨传青鸟，浮生寄白鸥。\n凄风兼苦雨，点滴到胸头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20173,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨二首 其一","author":"蒋葆元","text":"裹头吟倦夜无聊，斜拥鸳衾蜡渐消。\n不是秋声也难受，丝丝春雨滴芭蕉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20174,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春雨二首 其二","author":"蒋葆元","text":"冶春怕唱恼春词，憔悴新来病不支。\n除却狂歌兼痛饮，何曾开展一丝眉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20175,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"呈张尔常师用谢幼陶韵","author":"蒋葆元","text":"讲帷十载别匆匆，依旧春生杖履中。\n露布才华惊倚马，雪泥踪迹认飞鸿。\n访碑录就文心古，誓墓书成老手工。\n执梃愿为门下长，首先桃李占春风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20176,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒孝陵六首 其一","author":"蒋葆元","text":"九龙回抱郁葱葱，百尺佳城辇路通。\n星斗光芒腾宝气，风云叆叇护幽宫。\n山皴石骨疑蹲虎，桥耸波心认卧虹。\n隐恨福藩重驻跸，荒原酬酒哭秋风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20177,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒孝陵六首 其二","author":"蒋葆元","text":"手提三尺剑龙纹，跃马山河勘乱氛。\n建号龙飞明日月，宅京虎踞壮风云。\n东宫不禄悲传统，北道分藩误策勋。\n燕啄王孙同抱恨，大师何处吊孤坟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20178,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒孝陵六首 其三","author":"蒋葆元","text":"百尺红墙古柏围，参天黛色藓花肥。\n宝城永閟龙长卧，华表空留鹤未归。\n行脚老僧迎客懒，伤心废监守门稀。\n十三陵望昌平远，直北云烟接翠微。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20179,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒孝陵六首 其四","author":"蒋葆元","text":"龟趺七尺矗碑铭，轶宋追唐赞典型。\n殉国精忠陪侍从，明禋典礼肃神灵。\n龙髯痛哭遗弓坠，马鬣崇封古殿扃。\n南渡可怜埋骨处，英魂夜夜泣冬青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20180,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒孝陵六首 其五","author":"蒋葆元","text":"王气金陵一旦休，督师慷慨殉扬州。\n春方进禦蟾苏药，夜宴徵歌燕子楼。\n狐鼠成群嬉弱国，虎狼列镇拥强侯。\n九原示警荒陵哭，唤得痴人梦醒不？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20181,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒孝陵六首 其六","author":"蒋葆元","text":"沧桑感慨吊前朝，整步丹墀过小桥。\n鱼盌沈埋泉路閟，凫灯闪烁火光摇。\n遥青拄笏环晴嶂，远白飞帆涌暮潮。\n回首五云深处望，马蹄碎踏乱山骄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20182,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋前由馆返里","author":"蒋葆元","text":"一棹烟波里，微茫薄暮天。\n稻花香浥露，柳色淡含烟。\n石险潮声壮，波平月影圆。\n秋怀正萧瑟，渔唱起前川。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20183,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送周启贤自月城回郡二首 其一","author":"蒋葆元","text":"元夜春灯焕彩霞，团圞君正乍还家。\n盈盈劝釂樽前酒。\n缓缓归歌陌上花，桃叶新妆携素手，竹枝艳曲按红牙。\n阿侯入抱玲珑玉，戏綵萱帷笑语哗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20184,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送周启贤自月城回郡二首 其二","author":"蒋葆元","text":"卌年故我误儒衣，时命邅迍与世违。\n春雨心情连日恶，晨星朋旧近来稀。\n荻牙白茁河豚上，柳眼青含江鲚肥。\n试看两行襟上泪，送行时节为君挥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20185,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书怀","author":"蒋葆元","text":"慷慨寰中事，沧桑变劫灰。\n途穷争傲骨，世乱炼奇才。\n清气孕诗笔，牢愁消酒杯。\n请缨何日遂，壮志策风雷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20186,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书宋史密都统传后","author":"蒋葆元","text":"抚州城外进贤坪，上将星摇惨淡明。\n赴死敌犹称壮士，捐生节岂愧完人。\n忠臣儿痛市行乞，都统子听人问名。\n铸铁难消开阃罪，江潮怒作不平鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20187,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读周畇叔沤堂词","author":"蒋葆元","text":"词仙旖旎忒情多，粉黛亲调画翠蛾。\n十万莺花齐俯首，春风争唱洞仙歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20188,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋思偕陈心畬作二首 其一","author":"蒋葆元","text":"慷慨寰中事，乾坤此寓生。\n风泉满清听，草木变秋声。\n迂拙成何用，清狂亦累名。\n通才新献颂，犹喜说时清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20189,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋思偕陈心畬作二首 其二","author":"蒋葆元","text":"我亦悲秋者，飙轮感岁华。\n风蝉咽残柳，霜蝶媚幽花。\n山水供诗料，烟波隐钓槎。\n浮生何恋恋，随处是吾家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20190,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后","author":"蒋葆元","text":"雨过夕阳红，云容画秋意。\n深林寂无人，松竹滴苍翠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20191,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚春自城舟行旋月桥四首 其一","author":"蒋葆元","text":"乱红飞舞漾帘钩，逐队寻芳杜若洲。\n柳絮漫天花梦醒，诗成无处着春愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20192,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚春自城舟行旋月桥四首 其二","author":"蒋葆元","text":"三篙软碧涨鱼鳞，架上荼蘼蹙碎银。\n花事渐阑胡蝶懒，将离红剩可怜春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20193,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚春自城舟行旋月桥四首 其三","author":"蒋葆元","text":"篷窗点滴夜迢迢，蜡烛啼红焰未消。\n最是梦回听不得，风声和雨送春潮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20194,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚春自城舟行旋月桥四首 其四","author":"蒋葆元","text":"杨花情思太无聊，漂泊浮踪趁远飙。\n似我春心收不住，随风飞度赤阑桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20195,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏愁","author":"蒋葆元","text":"信似春潮日夜流，眉头双锁更心头。\n寒蛩呜咽织千缕，新月分明钓一钩。\n孤馆梦回初醒酒，春闺魂断独登楼。\n何当倒泻银河水，尽洗人间万斛愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20196,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清晓江行偕金声侣二首 其一","author":"蒋葆元","text":"划破半江碧，空濛散晓烟。\n潮迎双桨活，沫溅一篙圆。\n树影青连郭，山光绿到船。\n与君同把酒，高唱小游仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20197,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清晓江行偕金声侣二首 其二","author":"蒋葆元","text":"远水接天平，长空露洗清。\n春云幻奇态，朝旭媚新晴。\n溪鸟似相识，山花都未名。\n甲兵当十万，狐鼠漫横行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20198,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"需次皖江感怀","author":"蒋葆元","text":"风尘鞅掌卸征鞍，到此方知作客难。\n时事新翻棋局变，愁怀强借酒杯宽。\n可怜风雪三千路，算博朝廷一命官。\n羡煞江干垂钓叟，半生事业付渔竿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20199,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题谢孝子侍疾图","author":"赵良栻","text":"娱亲仍著老莱衣，慈竹平安愿已违。\n北斗香焚虔午夜，西山景迫恋春晖。\n诚通神鬼幽兰洁，梦入池塘寸草腓。\n十有八年如一日，抱铛孺慕等依依。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20200,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋虫","author":"赵良栻","text":"百卉雕零肃气浮，閒云黯淡不胜秋。\n萧萧木叶堆荒圃，唧唧虫声入破楼。\n草露寒烟三径晓，豆花凉月一棚幽。\n丁东檐马窗前响，四壁争鸣起暮愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20201,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆江南故宅","author":"夏诒","text":"碧天如水夜冲融，怕忆江南旧宅空。\n冷落双扉尘没槛，萧条四壁草成丛。\n庭前莺老无人管，江上鱼沈有梦通。\n应是金乌怜寂寞，朝来依旧下墙东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20202,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"病起","author":"夏诒","text":"一病蟾光四度圆，新痊初起正严寒。\n灯前儿女喃喃话，都道今宵睡不安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20203,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋前二日早起","author":"夏诒","text":"迢迢络纬曙光微，金井无人声渐稀。\n为爱晚凉临水立，不防花露湿罗衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20204,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄婿","author":"夏诒","text":"频挥双泪望天涯，失母孩童深自嗟。\n寄语温峤须记取，他年莫使衣芦花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20205,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"可中亭赏荷","author":"夏诒","text":"绮窗四面小亭东，十二兰干映水中。\n翠盖纷披侵入座，看花人映藕花红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20206,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金少尉夫人招饮口占一绝","author":"王仲霞","text":"画堂宴敞集群芳，侍女频添宝鸭香。\n茶鼎烟疏情话久，满栏花影正斜阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20207,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"王仲霞","text":"尽日炉中不炷香，恐他薰袭恼红妆。\n低头不敢高于竹，空负花中富贵王。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20208,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南旋拜别家大人作","author":"王仲霞","text":"雨露盈庭百卉生，集枯偏我境清贫。\n他年恐负衔环报，九转回肠怕受恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20209,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏寄外","author":"王仲霞","text":"绿肥红瘦昼如年，乳燕呢喃搅午眠。\n戏水蜻蜓芳草立，惊风蝴蝶落花旋。\n轻衫团扇无聊思，竹簟筠帘独自怜。\n暗祝盆荷教漫放，留看待并主人肩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20210,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"避寇纪事","author":"王仲霞","text":"骨肉离居西复东，今朝重聚一堂中。\n桃源偕隐休嫌僻，此地从无劫火红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20211,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"成衣寄外","author":"王仲霞","text":"中宵搜箧理霜纨，下剪还思称体难。\n寄语檀奴休厌弃，万蚕辛苦免号寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20212,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀萱堂就养江北","author":"王仲霞","text":"自别庭帏泪满襟，更无消息雁鱼沉。\n何时重效斑衣舞，依旧承欢遂素心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20213,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸丑避寇东阳偶成","author":"王仲霞","text":"桥跨清溪覆绿杨，春闺少女竞湔裳。\n行来渐觉乡音少，野渡人归唤夕阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20214,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲子仲春南岸寇警夫征不归音信睽隔者旬有馀日黯然赋此二首 其一","author":"王仲霞","text":"翘首云霄雁数行，深闺一日九回肠。\n南天贼势沿江恶，别绪离愁意渺茫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20215,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲子仲春南岸寇警夫征不归音信睽隔者旬有馀日黯然赋此二首 其二","author":"王仲霞","text":"烽烟遍野阻归程，日坐愁城梦亦惊。\n泪滴红绡都湿透，孤灯独自剔残更。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20216,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜外北渡","author":"王仲霞","text":"连宵灯蕊为谁开，鹊噪幽窗晓梦回。\n忽报入门闻笑语，一时惊喜转疑猜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20217,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送外子紫加入都二首 其一","author":"王仲霞","text":"检点轻装赴帝乡，离愁偏胜柳丝长。\n惟欣护物慈云好，能遣芝兰暗有香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20218,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送外子紫加入都二首 其二","author":"王仲霞","text":"寒暖加餐要自怜，名成犹恐误归鞭。\n心香一瓣殷勤祝，捧檄归来舞膝前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20219,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄外","author":"王仲霞","text":"回忆芸窗话曲衷，十年离合辄西东。\n身非綵凤随云翥，心与秋葵向日同。\n翠袖尚留新泪渍，征衣犹记旧裁工。\n谋生销尽轮蹄铁，幸有文章盖世雄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":20220,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]